data: {"id": "826f2ae1759b4642-thinking-parallel_evidence-885", "run_id": "826f2ae1759b4642", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集事实与结论（仅基于本次工具返回的真实数据）：\n\n- **Pod 身份与生命周期**\n  - namespace=pod aiops-case-v07，name=workload，node=node2，pod_ip=172.16.104.37。\n  - Phase=Pending；容器 app 的 State=Waiting，Reason=ImagePullBackOff；Restart Count=0；无 lastTerminated 记录。\n  - Metrics 基线也一致：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"}=1`，`restarts=0`，`phase=Pending=1`。\n\n- **镜像拉取失败原因（来自 Events）**\n  - kubelet 明确报：`Failed to pull image \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-2", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789443426275, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

